## TypeScript (.ts, .tsx, .mts, .cts) — VS Dark+ (Smax)
syntax typescript "\.(m|c)?tsx?$"
comment "//"

## Type / class names (PascalCase)
color #4cb "\<[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\>"
## Function / method calls:  name(
color #dda "[A-Za-z_$][A-Za-z0-9_$]*[[:space:]]*(\()"

## Declarations / modifiers
color #59c "\<(abstract|as|async|class|const|declare|enum|export|extends|function|implements|import|infer|instanceof|interface|is|keyof|let|namespace|new|private|protected|public|readonly|require|satisfies|static|super|this|type|var|from|get|set|module|override|out|accessor)\>"
## Built-in types
color #59c "\<(any|bigint|boolean|never|number|object|string|symbol|undefined|unknown|void)\>"

## Control flow
color #c8c "\<(if|else|switch|case|default|for|do|while|with|in|of|try|catch|finally|return|break|continue|throw|yield|await|typeof|delete)\>"

## Constants
color #59c "\<(true|false|null|undefined|NaN|Infinity)\>"
## Numbers
color #bca "\<([0-9][0-9_]*\.?[0-9_]*([eE][-+]?[0-9]+)?n?|0[xX][[:xdigit:]_]+)\>"

## Decorators  @Component
color #dda "@[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_.]*"

## Strings & template literals
color #c97 ""([^"\]|\\.)*"|'([^'\]|\\.)*'|`([^`\]|\\.)*`"

## Comments
color #6a5 "(^|[[:blank:]])//.*"
color #6a5 start="/\*" end="\*/"
